{"seq":2,"slug":"governing-by-non-action","title":"无为而治","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/ideas-and-methods/governing-by-non-action","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-art-of-wu-wei","title":"无为而治","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/ideas-and-methods/governing-by-non-action/the-art-of-wu-wei","wordCount":1956,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"ruling-a-great-state","title":"治大国若烹小鲜","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/ideas-and-methods/governing-by-non-action/ruling-a-great-state","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 无为而治\n\n本章阐述老子\"无为而治\"的政治智慧。\"无为而治\",主张统治者顺应自然、不妄加干预、让百姓自化；\"治大国若烹小鲜\",则生动地阐明了治国应当避免折腾。两篇文档，分别阐述无为而治，以及治大国若烹小鲜。\n"}